{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>I will make precious.</b> A verb issuing from the intensive [binyan] that is doubled [i.e., the pu'al], likewise <b>הוקר רגלך</b> (Proverbs 25:17)." "And the meaning of <b>a man</b> [is]: the males who will die in war."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:53:36.551978336Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}